3708:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         After enabling internal paths, before starting ADC conversion,
3709:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         a delay is required for internal voltage reference and
